// Program metadata for vscodium.
//
// kind=user → installed by the profile runner inside the chroot as the owning
// user via paru (vscodium-bin is AUR). The VSCodium Config is the opt-in parity
// twin of the Neovim Config (ADR 0148): same languages on the same Host Core
// system toolchain, extensions from Open VSX only. settings/keybindings (home/)
// are applied by the Runner's Config Apply pass (ADR 0134); install.sh installs
// the package + extensions.txt for the owning user. stow_opt_in: a no-name
// ./stow-configs.sh never sweeps an operator host's own VSCodium into the repo.
// Bundled-server exceptions and nvim-only gaps: see ADR 0148.

{
  "name": "vscodium",
  "kind": "user",
  "description": "VSCodium with nvim-parity extensions, settings and keymaps.",
  "stow_opt_in": true
}
